{{$NEXT}}
  - search and get take include_vectors => 1 to return the stored vector in
    Result->vector, which was documented but never populated
  - add_batch joins a transaction the caller already opened instead of dying
    with "Already in a transaction", like add and delete do
  - Collection names must match [A-Za-z0-9_]+ and distance_metric must be
    cosine, l2 or l1; anything else croaks before SQL runs instead of leaving
    a half-created collection behind
  - Reopening an existing collection with other dimensions or another
    distance_metric croaks, naming the stored and the requested value, instead
    of failing late inside sqlite-vec or silently misreading distances

